Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 17:33:57 2026 +1100

    l3: Check the function bodies in the DVR edge router
    
    The centralized floating IP NAT rules raise a RuntimeError naming
    snat_iptables_manager if they run before the SNAT gateway exists, and
    the DVR edge HA router's gateway removal raises one naming snat_ports if
    it runs before the first process(). Neither path can reach that today.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (high effort)
    Change-Id: If50292aecb19d0e94dd4fd3ad72f93363e409204
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

